<p><a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/wsq-business-innovation-with-agentic-ai-and-ai-agents.html"><strong>WSQ - Business Innovation with Agentic AI and AI Agents</strong></a>, course code <strong>TGS-2023037472</strong>, is a two-day course built around those three questions. You move from <strong>opportunities</strong> to <strong>action</strong> to <strong>driving the AI transformation in your company</strong>, and the class adds one extra hands-on topic: vibe coding a business website.</p>

