<p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Complete this course and, as a <strong>Singapore Citizen aged 18 or above</strong>, you can redeem a <strong>6-month free subscription</strong> to one premium AI tool: ChatGPT Plus, Google AI Pro, Manus AI, Microsoft 365 Personal or Singtel AI Pass.</p>
<p style="margin:0;">After the course, SWDA emails you a redemption form. Choose your tool within 60 days. One subscription per person. <a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/blog/how-to-claim-free-ai-subscription-singapore-eligibility-steps-courses"><strong>See how redemption works &rarr;</strong></a></p>
