</div>
<p>The subscription follows the course: it is redeemed after you complete it, so it supports what you do next, such as refining your action plan, testing agent ideas and continuing to build your website. A consumer subscription is separate from paid API access, which some automation tools bill on their own.</p>
<p>Read the full eligibility rules and steps in <a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/blog/how-to-claim-free-ai-subscription-singapore-eligibility-steps-courses">How to Claim Your Free 6-Month AI Subscription in Singapore</a>, or browse all <a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/free-ai-subscription-courses.html">free AI subscription courses</a>.</p>

