<h2>Who should attend</h2>
<p>Business owners, managers, team leads and professionals who are expected to bring AI into their work and want a structured way to do it. The course is about business decisions and planning. You need basic computer skills and a free account on a generative AI assistant; you do not need to be a programmer.</p>

<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>Do I get the free AI subscription when I enrol?</h3>
<p>No. You redeem it after completing the course. SWDA sends a redemption email, and you choose your tool within 60 days.</p>
<h3>Who can claim the free AI subscription?</h3>
<p>Singapore Citizens aged 18 or above who complete a course carrying the Free AI Subscription label. Each person can redeem one subscription.</p>
<h3>Do I need coding experience for the vibe coding topic?</h3>
<p>No. You describe the website you want in plain English and the AI tool builds it. You guide and refine the result.</p>
<h3>Is the course funded?</h3>
<p>Yes, it is a WSQ course. Eligible Singapore Citizens and Permanent Residents may receive up to 70% course-fee funding, subject to the applicable criteria.</p>
